    <string name="vpn_limitation_title">No device-wide VPN</string>
    <string name="vpn_limitation_body">Aether exposes a local SOCKS5/HTTP proxy. Apps that respect proxy settings can use it; device traffic is not automatically routed via TUN/VpnService. A VpnService implementation would be needed for system-wide routing.</string>

